{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56126","headline":"步虚词 十九 · 杜光庭","name":"步虚词 十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一炁化之元，邈在两仪先。\n宝埒驰金马，真香喷玉莲。\n飞空按龙辔，梵响导芝軿。\n绵永长春刼，翶翔无色天。\n初真难晓谕，以此戒中仙。\n（同前。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56126.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56126","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}